msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOGREENHOUSE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SAITOGREENHOUSE\">Greenhouse</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SAITOGREENHOUSE\">温室</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOGREENHOUSE.DESC"
msgid "Eighteen farm plots on three shelves, behind glass."
msgstr "3段の棚に18区画の畑、すべてガラスの向こう。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOGREENHOUSE.EFFECT"
msgid "Grows 18 crops on three shelves of six (pick the crop on the Config tab). The shelves follow the crop: hanging trays for ceiling crops such as Pincha Pepper, two levels of three for trees, one vine for the Ovagro Node.\n\nDuplicants deliver the seeds, fertilizer and water, and harvest ripe crops at the base. Every crop follows a vanilla farm's rules: temperature, atmosphere and pressure, light or darkness, radiation and plant mutations.\n\nPipe gas into it to give the crops their own atmosphere, or leave it open to the room. A liquid pipe and a conveyor rail can bring the water and solids instead of Duplicants.\n\nBuilt in, each after its vanilla building's research: glow tubes that light crops which need it (power by the light they add), Farmer's Touch, insulation and thermal regulation. In Spaced Out, a radiation lamp burns Phosphorite like Shine Bugs do to give mutated crops the radiation they need."
msgstr "6株ずつ3段の棚で18株の作物を育てる（作物は設定タブで選ぶ）。棚は作物に合わせて変わる：ピンチャペッパーのような天井作物には吊り下げトレイ、木には3本ずつ2段、オバグロノードには1本のつる。\n\n複製人間が種、肥料、水を運び込み、実った作物を土台で収穫する。どの作物もバニラの農場のルールに従う：温度、大気と気圧、光または暗闇、放射線、植物の変異。\n\nガスをパイプで送り込めば作物専用の大気になり、部屋に開いたままにもできる。液体パイプとコンベアレールで、複製人間の代わりに水や固体を運べる。\n\n内蔵機能（それぞれバニラの建物の研究後に使える）：光が必要な作物を照らす蛍光管（足した光の分だけ電力を使う）、ファーマーズタッチ、断熱、温度調節。スペースドアウトでは、放射線ランプがシャインバグと同じようにリン鉱石を燃やし、変異作物に必要な放射線を与える。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOAQUATICGREENHOUSE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SAITOAQUATICGREENHOUSE\">Aquatic Greenhouse</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SAITOAQUATICGREENHOUSE\">水中温室</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOAQUATICGREENHOUSE.DESC"
msgid "Eighteen underwater plots on three shelves, in a tank behind glass."
msgstr "ガラスの向こうの水槽で、3段の棚に18区画の水中の畑。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOAQUATICGREENHOUSE.EFFECT"
msgid "Grows 18 underwater crops such as Waterweed, Tublia and Starnacle on three shelves of six, with hanging trays for Seakomb (pick the crop on the Config tab).\n\nPipe liquid in to fill the tank up to its fill level: it is the crops' water and atmosphere, and a shelf above the waterline doesn't grow. Duplicants deliver the seeds and solid fertilizer and harvest at the base; a liquid output takes liquid harvests.\n\nBuilt in, each after its vanilla building's research: glow tubes for crops that need light, Farmer's Touch, and thermal regulation of the whole tank (a Liquid Tepidizer and Thermo Aquatuner)."
msgstr "ウォーターウィード、チューブリア、スターナクルのような水中作物18株を6株ずつ3段の棚で育て、シーコームは吊り下げトレイを使う（作物は設定タブで選ぶ）。\n\n液体をパイプで送り込み、水槽を設定した水位まで満たす：それが作物の水と大気で、水面より上の棚は育たない。複製人間が種と固体肥料を運び込み、土台で収穫する。液体出力口が液体の収穫物を受け取る。\n\n内蔵機能（それぞれバニラの建物の研究後に使える）：光が必要な作物を照らす蛍光管、ファーマーズタッチ、水槽全体の温度調節（リキッドテピダイザーとサーモアクアチューナー）。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOHANGINGGREENHOUSE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SAITOGREENHOUSE\">Greenhouse</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SAITOGREENHOUSE\">温室</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SAITOHANGINGGREENHOUSE.DESC"
